      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَجُلَ</span></b> , aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَجُلَ</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَجَالَةٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بُجُولٌ</span>, <i>He</i> (a
man) <i>was,</i> or <i>became, such as is termed</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَجَال</span> <i>and</i>

<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَجِيل</span> [i. e. <i>magnified, honoured,</i> &amp;c.]. f[g(K.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2- 
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَجَلَ</span>, aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَجَلَ</span></b> ; and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَجَلَ</span>, aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَجُلَ</span></b> ; inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَجْلٌ</span> and
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بُجُولٌ</span>; <i>He was,</i> or <i>became, in a good state</i> or
<i>condition; having abundance of herbage,</i> or <i>of
the goods</i> or <i>conveniences</i> or <i>comforts of life.</i> (K.)
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And <i>He was,</i> or <i>became, joyful, glad,</i> or
<i>happy.</i> (K.) ＝   
